  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n5m² + 18m + 16 = 0\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 5m2 + 18m + 16 = 0\n\n⇒ 5m² + 10m + 8m + 16 = 0\n\n⇒ 5m(m + 2) + 8(m + 2) = 0\n\n⇒ (5m + 8)(m + 2) = 0\n\n⇒ 5m + 8 = 0 or m + 2 = 0\n\n⇒ m = -8/5 or m = -2\n\n**∴ The roots are -8/5 and -2.**",
